<title>CHINA: China interbank market rates (CHIBOR).</title>
<headline>China interbank market rates (CHIBOR).</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the China Interbank Offered Rate (CHIBOR) for Wednesday issued by the official Xinhua news agency on behalf of the People's Bank of China, the central bank.</p>
<p>The figures represent weighted averages and not closing prices and are annual percentage rates.</p>
<p>		1DAY   7DAY  20DAY  30DAY  60DAY  90DAY  120DAY</p>
<p> WEDNESDAY 10.080 11.370  N/A   10.562 10.726 10.881  N/A</p>
<p> TUESDAY   10.080 11.077 11.255 11.050 11.103 10.676 13.330</p>
<p>Turnover fell sharply to 724 million yuan from 1.936 billion yuan on Tuesday with the one-day contract the most actively traded.</p>
</text>
